# Committed compiled web assets. Dockerfile.release regenerates these from the
# ui-builder stage and COPYs the fresh output over ./internal/server/dist before
# the Go build, so the checked-in copy is stale build output that only bloats the
# build context; noui image builds embed nothing here at all.
